## 🛠️ Project Roles / Responsibilities

Contributing to multiple AI-driven projects under **Humanitarians AI × Stellis Labs**:

### **Adam - The Quiz Maker & Eva - The Gamified Companion**
- Developed RAG-powered educational chatbots using LangFlow and ChromaDB for intelligent quiz generation and personalized learning experiences.
- Implemented gamification features including badges, levels, and feedback systems to enhance user engagement and learning retention.
- Designed complex decision logic using LangFlow workflows with custom decider nodes for dynamic conversation flow management.
- Created comprehensive documentation and demo videos, showcasing projects on LinkedIn for professional visibility.

### **Simulation Engine**
- Architected FastAPI-based backend infrastructure for agent-based simulation platform with scalable database integration.
- Implemented comprehensive logging system for real-time monitoring and debugging of simulation processes.
- Developed sample simulation agents and established GitHub-based project management workflow with organized ticketing system.
- Delivered successful project demonstrations showcasing agent interactions and system capabilities.

### **Deep Research Engine**
- Built end-to-end research automation system achieving 80% reduction in literature review time through intelligent query expansion and multi-source retrieval.
- Engineered semantic query expansion using transformer models (SentenceTransformers, GROQ) to convert broad queries into domain-specific academic searches.
- Developed cross-platform retrieval architecture with unified adapters for Arxiv, PubMed, and Google Scholar APIs via Model Context Protocol.
- Implemented hybrid relevance scoring pipeline combining semantic similarity, authority indicators, and recency for optimal paper ranking.
- Created metadata-driven caching system using DuckDB and ChromaDB, ensuring 100% source traceability and eliminating redundant API calls.
- Built Gradio UI interface enabling non-technical users to leverage advanced research capabilities through intuitive web interface.
- Stress-tested system with 100+ academic sources, maintaining sub-5 minute processing time for complex multi-query research tasks.
